The corrected checker now accepts arbitrary cycle and outer-list order while still rejecting the oracle replies semantically. The full local suite passes again; the membership-swap corruption now fails because it destroys a directed cycle, giving the required fifth distinct reason. I’m rerunning the official harness so its transcript is generated against this final verifier rather than relying on a post-hoc rescore.
